OL,3,GNEWSA'I was ashamed of my hoarding and
OL,4,Acouldn't move on with my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany of us would admit to owning too
OL,7,Fmany possessions and being surrounded
OL,8,Fby clutter, but what happens if our
OL,9,Fbehaviour starts turning to hoarding?
OL,11,FPeople who struggle to organise their
OL,12,Fbelongings often report having mental
OL,13,Fhealth issues and an overwhelming sense
OL,14,Fof being out of control.
OL,16,FThe mess can lead to feelings of
OL,17,Fembarrassment and shame, according to
OL,18,Fdecluttering and mental health
OL,19,Fprofessionals.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
